{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40009","label":"Collab 01 · Part 2"},"label":"Traces of Those Who Left","stage":null,"prev":"event_ce_01_09_e","next":null,"speakers":{"andersen":"Andersen","Self":"Commander","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","rapi":"Rapi","Narration":"Narration"},"icons":{"andersen":"si_c903_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","Narration":"si_c999_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_1","text":"Within one hour of the Gatekeeper's awakening, everything disappears.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_inark","movie":null,"shown":["andersen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_2","text":"The research materials, the remains of the Raptures, everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_3","text":"At least this means the matter is closed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_4","text":"There was only one survivor from the research team.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_5","text":"By pure happenstance, she ended up between two buildings, and she was never caught by the Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_6","text":"She's been looking into the Gatekeeper's past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_7","text":"Apparently, it has done this exact thing hundreds of times before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_8","text":"It goes to different planets and incites strife between the local inhabitants and the beings it manifests from its dreams.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_9","text":"In the most severe cases, the world itself collapsed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_10","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_11","text":"This is just my personal opinion,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_12","text":"but I'm willing to bet that none of this would have happened if just one person had attempted talking instead of trying to use force.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_13","text":"Unfortunately for the Gatekeeper, its luck ran out when it met you guys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_14","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_14","text":"Do we have any idea what the Gatekeeper was trying to achieve?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_15","text":"None whatsoever.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_16","text":"Perhaps it was interested in watching a good fight between two factions, or maybe it simply wanted its dreams to become a reality.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_17","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_17","text":"Dream? What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_18","text":"Ah right, you were never filled in... Just ignore what I said, then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_19","text":"At any rate, there's no way of ascertaining what the Gatekeeper hoped to achieve.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_20","text":"So I'll consider this matter closed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_21","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_21","text":"What happens next?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_22","text":"I'll erase any records of the Gatekeeper and the Devil Hunters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_23","text":"It's all well beyond the realm of our reality. Any records would simply cause more confusion than is necessary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_24","text":"In summary, I'm saying let's pretend nothing happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_25","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_25","text":"Very well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_26","text":"Go get some rest. You sure deserve it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_27","text":"What a bunch of animals! They left empty bottles and cigarette butts everywhere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"NikkeRoom","bgArt":"nikkeroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_languor","movie":null,"shown":["neon","anis","rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_28","text":"NOOOO! They ate the snacks we were saving for an occasion!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_29","text":"At least they left the Splendamin bars... they didn't even touch them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_30","text":"Haha, only because they had them before and hated 'em.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_31","text":"Let's clean up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_32","text":"Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_33","text":"It's hard to tell what they left behind, but it sure is easy to tell what went missing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_34","text":"Let's fill it back with our own stuff. Some new stuff.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_35","text":"Despite all of this... it does feel kinda lonely without them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_epilogue_36","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_epilogue_36","text":"BULLET X CHAINSAW : END","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}